│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ analytic_softmin_anneal13                                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ The current program uses slow finite-difference gradients (52 extra full area evaluations │
│                          │ per iteration), few effective restarts, and a weak regular-polygon seed bias. The new     │
│                          │ version replaces finite differences with exact analytic gradients of the LogSumExp        │
│                          │ soft-min objective (computed via bincount accumulation over the 286 triples, ~50x cheaper │
│                          │ per iteration), which allows many more optimization iterations and restarts within the    │
│                          │ same time budget. Key parameter changes: annealed sharpness p from 40→400 (stronger late  │
│                          │ focus on the worst triangle), 400 iterations per restart (vs 220), 24 diverse seeds       │
│                          │ (regular 13-gon, double rings with varied radii/offsets, hexagonal clusters, jittered     │
│                          │ lattices, and seeded random), and cosine-decayed learning rate. The final configuration   │
│                          │ is selected by the true normalized score (min triangle area / hull area), with            │
│                          │ duplicate-point safety and a deterministic fallback.                                      │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0128                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ z-ai/glm-5.3                                                                              │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
