│                          │ candidates using the *true* objective min_area / hull_area, including a hull-expansion    │
│                          │ move (scaling all points outward) inside the pattern search, since pushing points toward  │
│                          │ the hexagon boundary increases min triangle area while hull area stays capped at the      │
│                          │ hexagon area.                                                                             │
