│                          │ helps escape configurations where interior points are crowded and hull growth is          │
│                          │ score-beneficial; (2) cut the expensive softmin gradient iterations roughly in half       │
│                          │ (2500→1200 and step decay adjusted) since the gradient stage mostly serves as             │
│                          │ initialization for the exact polish, reducing eval time toward the 5.7s of the best       │
│                          │ variant while leaving polish quality intact. The polish remains fully deterministic       │
│                          │ (seeded RNG) and operates on the exact objective, so improvements are guaranteed real     │
│                          │ score gains.                                                                              │
