│ patch_name               │ multi_seed_funnel_with_worst_triangle_polish                                              │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the single circle-seed coordinate descent with a broad deterministic funnel: 72   │
│                          │ seeds (random interior, jittered circle, 3-fold symmetric rings), a fast screening pass   │
│                          │ with coarse polish on the top 24, and an exact greedy hill-climb on the top 10 that moves │
│                          │ the vertices of the current worst triangle (worst-case-driven refinement). The            │
│                          │ min-triangle evaluation is vectorized via a precomputed 286-triple index array, giving    │
│                          │ roughly a 50× speedup over the per-point loop and freeing the time budget for breadth —   │
│                          │ exactly what broke the plateau (Gen 27's 60–72 seeds reached 0.81, Gen 31's four-stage    │
│                          │ funnel 0.84). Objective throughout is min_triangle_area / hull_area, so hull spread is    │
│                          │ optimized jointly with triangle regularity.                                               │
