│                          │ recomputing the cheap 13-point hull exactly) makes each climb step ~4x faster, letting us │
│                          │ widen Stage 2 polish from top-14 to top-20 and increase climb iterations substantially    │
│                          │ within the same wall-clock budget. This converts directly into higher                     │
│                          │ min_area_normalized, per the recommendation from Gen 36's proven approach.                │
