│                          │ reducing the hull-area denominator while checking that min triangle area degrades slower  │
│                          │ than hull area, directly attacking the ratio. This exploits the score =                   │
│                          │ min_area/hull_area structure that the previous pure coordinate-descent programs ignored.  │
│                          │ Multi-start deterministic seeds, vectorized exact triple enumeration, and a global        │
│                          │ "shrink move" (never tried before) allow escaping the 0.03 plateau. Final result is       │
