│                          │ selection still uses the exact min/hull ratio. (3) Expand the seed set (more random       │
│                          │ restarts plus 6-fold lattice-like seeds), use 8-directional (diagonal) moves instead of   │
│                          │ axis-only for faster/better local search, and an adaptive step schedule with faster       │
